OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Mail told to 'get a grip' on
OL,4,Apostal delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FPostal delays in a Warwickshire
OL,7,Fneighbourhood are leaving residents
OL,8,Fwithout vital letters, causing missed
OL,9,Fhospital appointments, unpaid fines and
OL,10,Fundelivered birthday cards, locals say.
OL,12,FMartin Saxby, from the Brownsover area
OL,13,Fof Rugby, began investigating after
OL,14,Fnoticing post was repeatedly failing to
OL,15,Farrive at his home, including birthday
OL,16,Fcards for his wife.
OL,18,FAfter speaking to neighbours he
OL,19,Fdiscovered the issue was affecting
OL,20,Fhouseholds across the community, with
OL,21,Fsome reporting a three-week delay in
OL,22,Fpostal services.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
